  <!-- OUR STORY -->
  <section aria-labelledby="story-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="story-grid">
        <h2 id="story-heading">Why We Created HowFixIt</h2>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p>Everyday problems don't always require complicated solutions. Most of the time, people simply need clear instructions, the right information, and a practical place to start.</p>
          <p>HowFixIt was created to make that process easier by bringing useful how-to information together in one accessible platform.</p>
          <p>From household cleaning and maintenance to technology troubleshooting and everyday organization, our goal is to provide straightforward guides that help readers understand what to do and how to do it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

